---
source: crates/biome_formatter_test/src/snapshot_builder.rs
info: yaml/mapping/duplicated-keys/flow-mapping.yml
---

# Input

```yml
{
  foo: 1,
  foo: {
    bar: 1,
    bar: 2
  }
}

---
{
  ? foo
  : 1,
  ? foo
  : 2
}

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@
 { foo: 1, foo: { bar: 1, bar: 2 } }
 ---
-{ foo: 1, foo: 2 }
+{ ? foo
+  : 1, ? foo
+  : 2 }
```

# Output

```yml
{ foo: 1, foo: { bar: 1, bar: 2 } }
---
{ ? foo
  : 1, ? foo
  : 2 }
```
